<v Steve>Well, let's split up and find another way off this oversized freezer.

9
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,051
<v Claire>Right.

10
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,620
<v Steve>Okay, let's do it!

14
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,630
<v Steve>Claire, it looks like there's an Australian observation base about seven miles away

14
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:07,020
<v Steve>from here. That should be our target.

15
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,010
<v Claire>Then if we can break through the wall with that digging vehicle, we might have a

15
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:05,460
chance. Okay. Let's do it!

16
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,270
<v Claire>Great news! And take a look at that! It's a digging vehicle!

16
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:05,900
<v Claire>If we break the wall with it, we might have a chance!

16
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:08,160
Okay! Let's do it!

18
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,580
Nooo

19
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Steve, watch out!

20
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Come on!

24
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
It's toxic gas!

25
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Okay.

33
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,920
Ah, we're safe now. Think again, Claire.

35
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,220
<v Alexia>I shall enjoy watching you shriek in agony.

36
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,260
<v Claire>Not this time!

38
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
You again!

44
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,260
<v Claire>What was that?

49
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,340
<v Steve>Claire, come on! Finally we can get out of this insane place!

50
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Okay, let's go!

51
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
<v Steve>Hurry up! Go, go, go!

56
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,158
<v Claire>Steve!

57
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,460
<v Claire>Hold on! I'll waste that monster and come back!

59
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,160
<v Steve>Claire, forget about me. Run!

62
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
<v Claire>I've got you now!

64
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Are you alright?

70
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,130
<v Steve>Claire!

70
00:00:01,180 --> 00:00:02,380
<v Steve>You're alive!

71
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,980
<v Claire>Don't worry about it. Let's go.

74
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,480
<v Steve>I'm sorry. I failed you.

88
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,380
