88
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:05,080
<v Rodrigo>Who are you?

89
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,100
<v Chris>I came here looking for a certain girl.

90
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Rodrigo>A girl?

91
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,380
<v Chris>Have you seen anyone named Claire Redfield?

92
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,180
<v Rodrigo>Did you just say... Claire?

93
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,140
<v Chris>You know who she is, don't you?

94
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,240
<v Rodrigo>Don't worry about her.

95
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Rodrigo>I helped her escape.

95
00:00:01,820 --> 00:00:04,920
<v Rodrigo>Several planes took off from this island not long ago.

95
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:09,420
<v Rodrigo>While I can't say for certain, she was probably on one of them.

96
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>I see.

96
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:03,320
<v Chris>I guess my sister owes you.

96
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,540
<v Chris>Thanks for helping her.

97
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Rodrigo>Everyone's gone.

97
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:04,680
<v Rodrigo>I may be the only other person left.

97
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:06,780
<v Rodrigo>Go on.

97
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:09,820
<v Rodrigo>Follow your sister and get off this island.

101
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:06,360
<v Rodrigo>Looks like I can meet my family again.

101
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:11,320
<v Rodrigo>Here, take this.

102
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>What?

103
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,930
<v Rodrigo>She gave this to me as a token of thanks for saving

103
00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:07,180
<v Rodrigo>her.

103
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:11,620
<v Rodrigo>I won't need it anymore.

103
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,980
<v Rodrigo>Take it.

104
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,520
<v Chris>I'll take you to join your family.

105
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>Who is that?

106
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
<v Wesker>Alexia? No!

108
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,500
<v Wesker>And she's already fully awake.

110
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,082
<v Wesker>Chris.

111
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
<v Wesker>I'm sending some company to keep you entertained.

112
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,060
<v Wesker>Consider this a small welcoming gift from me.

113
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Wesker>Enjoy!

115
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,308
<v Wesker>Long time no see, Chris.

116
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>Wesker?

117
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,380
<v Chris>You're still alive?

119
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>What are you doing here?

121
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,926
<v Chris>Who?

122
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,040
<v Wesker>They hired me to capture her.

123
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,990
<v Chris>Wait!

124
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,742
<v Chris>You attacked the island!

125
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,220
<v Chris>And my sister!

137
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Alexia?

140
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>Hold on, Claire.

140
00:00:01,660 --> 00:00:02,860
<v Chris>I'll save you.

141
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,340
<v Chris>What? He's here?

142
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
<v Chris>Who could have done this?

144
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Alexia!

146
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,660
<v Alexia>That is how I dispose of insignificant bugs.

147
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,740
<v Alexia>Set the spider to the fly.

148
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,620
<v Alexia>How do you wish to die?

152
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Chris!

153
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>Claire.

154
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,740
<v Claire>I missed you so much.

156
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,720
<v Chris>I know, but we have to get out of here.

157
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,660
<v Claire>Not yet. We have to find Steve.

158
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
