160
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,440
<v Chris>So that means Steve is still somewhere in this base?

161
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>Claire?

161
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:02,940
<v Chris>What's wrong?

162
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,720
<v Claire>I think... I think I've been poisoned.

163
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>I'm sure of it.

164
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>Just hold on.

166
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>Feeling better?

167
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Thanks to you.

167
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:06,040
<v Claire>Just like a big brother, huh? You're always looking out for your little sister.

169
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>It's Alexia!

172
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>After her!

173
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
<v Chris>She might know where Steve is.

174
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Let's go!

177
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,088
<v Claire>Chris!

178
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
Nooo

180
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
<v Chris>Just go. I'll be fine.

181
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>But Chris!

182
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,020
<v Chris>You've got to save Steve. Go!

195
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Steve?

208
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,680
<v Wesker>At last, I've found you, Alexia.

209
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Wesker>Come with me!

211
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,880
<v Wesker>You're responsible for the creation of the T-Veronica virus.

212
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,020
<v Wesker>And now the only existing sample is in your body.

213
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,760
<v Wesker>I want it. Now!

214
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Alexia>You want it?

214
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:05,800
<v Alexia>You are not worthy of its power!

219
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,051
<v Chris>Claire?

220
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>Is that you, Claire?

224
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,840
<v Chris>Hey, is Steve with you?

227
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>Listen, Claire.

233
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>You made it!

234
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
