269
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,760
Nooo

274
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>No!

275
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:05,560
Wait!

278
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Don't say that!

279
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Listen to me.

280
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,860
<v Claire>We'll escape from here. Together.

281
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Come on!

282
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,230
<v Claire>We've got to shut off the gas. If we split up, we'll have a better chance of

282
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:05,480
<v Claire>stopping it.

283
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Steve!

284
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Don't forget!

285
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>We'll get out of here.

286
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Together!

289
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:12,830
No! I can't do it! Who did this to you? That crazy woman

289
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:18,090
<v Steve>told me she was going to perform the same experiment on me

289
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:23,320
<v Steve>that she did on her own father. She's completely insane!

293
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Steve!

294
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>No, wait!

296
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Chris...

297
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:06,660
<v Claire>Steve, he...

298
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
<v Claire>No! I can't!

300
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,660
<v Claire>Chris, there should be a self-destruct system somewhere.

300
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:10,480
<v Claire>If you activate it, all the electronic locks might be deactivated.

301
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,920
<v Wesker>I came for Alexia.

302
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,380
<v Wesker>An organization hired me to capture her.

312
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
Whoa, what power!

313
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,940
Chris, you're here?

326
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>See you around, Claire!

327
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>Adios.

332
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,220
<v Steve>Chris Redfield.

333
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
<v Steve>Machine guns? For me?

336
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
<v Steve>I... I can't!

338
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>No!

339
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,060
<v Steve>Ugh, what are you doing here? We're running out of time!

342
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,240
<v Steve>It's all my fault!

343
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,160
<v Steve>I swear I'll protect you next time, Claire.

344
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
Ugh, Claire.

348
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Claire Redfield.

352
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,660
<v Steve>Come on, let's go! What, are you scared?

353
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Move it!

356
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,480
<v Chris>Following up on a lead given to me by Leon has brought me here.

359
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>Don't worry, Claire.

359
00:00:01,540 --> 00:00:02,940
<v Chris>I'm coming to save you.

360
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,060
<v Chris>Claire, I'll take care of you now.

365
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,052
<v Chris>Claire?

366
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,380
<v Chris>No! The door won't open!

368
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,460
<v Chris>We have to get out of here immediately.

369
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,300
<v Chris>Can you unlock it from the inside?

371
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
<v Alexia>Who is there? Is someone at the corridor?

373
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,400
<v Alexia>N-nothing. I believe I must have been imagining things.

375
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
<v Computer>Please deposit any metallic items you have in the security box.

376
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,750
<v Computer>Biohazard contamination detected. Level 3.

376
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:09,520
<v Computer>Emergency shutters will close. All personnel evacuate immediately.

377
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,180
<v Computer>Biohazard contamination detected. Level S.

377
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:10,010
<v Computer>Instruction A executed. The following area has been

377
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:14,990
<v Computer>sealed off. Area C. Area F.

377
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:16,960
<v Computer>Area J.

390
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,160
<v Computer>Five minutes until detonation.

392
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,980
<v Steve>Huh? Hey! This thing's empty! You cheated me!

393
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Arrgh! Steve!

394
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,080
The self-destruct system has been... That freak!

394
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:05,880
<v Steve>He's trying to blow us up along with the entire facility!

394
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:08,920
<v Steve>Come on, we gotta get to that airport! Right!

395
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,980
<v Computer>The self-destruct system has been activated.

395
00:00:03,630 --> 00:00:07,100
<v Computer>All personnel evacuate immediately.

398
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:04,200
Hold on! Don't give up!

402
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Whoa! No!

403
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:05,600
What's wrong?

403
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:18,070
Claire can't breathe. Claire,

403
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:20,180
help me.

404
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,640
<v Steve>Claire! What are you doing? Let's go!

405
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>Let's get out of here!

406
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>We gotta get to that airport!

413
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:08,710
<v Wesker>You have no idea how much I hate you. You destroyed my

413
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:13,360
<v Wesker>plans. So now I've sold my soul to a new organization.

413
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:16,300
<v Wesker>Now die.

415
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:08,430
<v Wesker>Here's a little secret, Chris. I figured out that your sister is now in the

415
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:14,620
<v Wesker>Antarctic. With Alexia. It's too bad you won't be seeing her again.

417
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,940
<v Claire>Alexia? There really is an Alexia?

417
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:10,340
<v Alexia>It is almost time, you genetically inferior siblings!

423
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,700
<v Computer>This facility will detonate in five minutes.

424
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
<v Computer>All doors are now unlocked.

432
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,480
<v Wesker>Chris, oh little fishy, come see my hook.

433
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,620
<v Wesker>You're coming with me.

434
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,100
Chris!

435
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>Wesker.

437
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
<v Wesker>Chris.

438
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,580
<v Wesker>Since you're one of my best men.

439
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,840
<v Wesker>I'll let you handle this.

440
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Chris!

443
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,170
<v Wesker>Move.

444
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>Claire!

445
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,179
No!

446
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Chris!

448
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,220
<v Wesker>Well done, Chris. It turns out that Alexia's work wasn't much of anything.

448
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:07,920
<v Wesker>So now the only thing left is revenge.

449
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,540
<v Chris>Let her go, Wesker! You don't want her!

450
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Wesker>Fine.

452
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,126
<v Chris>Claire!

455
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,840
<v Wesker>Today's a good day. I came for Alexia, but killing you is even better.

456
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,680
<v Chris>Sorry to disappoint you, but Alexia is gone.

457
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,560
<v Wesker>That's no longer a concern to me. I have Steve to work with.

458
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>What?

459
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Steve.

460
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,686
<v Wesker>In his body, there's still a living T-Alexia virus.

461
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
<v Wesker>Steve should be a good specimen.

462
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,040
<v Wesker>Maybe he'll come back alive, just as I did, and be able to see your sister again.

463
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>You freak!

464
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Don't you touch him!

465
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Wesker>I'm sorry, dear heart.

466
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,940
<v Wesker>But my men have already taken him.

467
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>You get out of here, Claire.

468
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>But what about...

469
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,660
<v Chris>As a surviving member of S.T.A.R.S., I have to finish this.

470
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
<v Claire>Okay, remember your promise.

471
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,300
<v Chris>I'll end this once and for all. Say hello to my comrades who you've killed.

472
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,120
<v Wesker>I don't know where you get your confidence, Chris.

479
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,050
Go!

483
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,060
<v Wesker>Sure, I'm not human anymore.

490
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
<v Wesker>But just look at the power I've gained!

491
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,560
<v Wesker>Magnificent!

492
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,220
<v Wesker>Don't you think?

497
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Wesker>Nice try.

498
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Chris>Wesker.

501
